		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Obtained the {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Too bad!\nThe Bag is full...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtained\nthe {COLOR 2}{STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}{COLOR 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtained\nthe {COLOR 1}{STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}{COLOR 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put the {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}\nin the {COLOR 2}{STRVAR_1 31, 2, 0}{COLOR 0} Pocket.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put the {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0}\nin the {COLOR 2}{STRVAR_1 31, 2, 0}{COLOR 0} Pocket.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} put away the\n{STRVAR_1 31, 1, 0} in the Fashion Case.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} logged into\nthe plug’s PC.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which PC should be accessed? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokémon Storage System\ngot accessed. Bill say wassup.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Accessed {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s PC.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oak’s words echoed... {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nThere’s a time and place for\feverythin’! But not now. Put that\naway.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup! Whatchu need?\nWe got it. Prob’ly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">THERE! All happy and healthy! Good luck\nout there. Stay outta the grass.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mom: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Welcome home, baby!\rSound like you been through it out\nthere. You eatin’? You look thin.\rTake a nap and relax. Your room still\nmessy, by the way.\r... ...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mom: Oh, good! You and your homies\nlookin’ GREAT.\rOh, Professor Elm called. At 3 AM.\nAgain.\rHe said a homie’s energy is called HP.\nHit Points. Like a video game.\rIf your homies lose HP, any Trap House\nwill fix ’em up for free.\rIf you goin’ far, stock up on Hennessy\nat the Corner Store. For THEM, not\fyou.\rMake me proud, baby! Take care! Call\nyour mama!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mom: Oh, good! You and your homies\nlookin’ GREAT.\rOh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your homie faint if it run\noutta HP.\rIf your homie low on HP, come home\nbefore it pass out. I’ll make soup.\rA nap at home fix EVERYTHING.\rMake me proud, baby! Take care! Call\nyour mama!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">First, let’s get your homies patched\nup. Hold still. All of y’all.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your homies healed up to PERFECT\nhealth. Like brand new. Like they never\fgot jumped.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hit a Trap House when your homies’ HP\ngo down.\rIf you travelin’ far, stock up on\nHennessy at a Corner Store.\rGood luck, Hustler! Don’t die!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s no Mail in the Mailbox.\nJust bills. And a coupon for pizza.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not even a nibble...\nThe fish is avoidin’ you personally.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The homie got away...\nIt ain’t wanna be your homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Reeled it in too quick...\nPatience, bro. Patience.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Landed a homie! Fresh catch!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} survived the bad tacos.\nIts stomach settled!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">♂</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">♀</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There ain’t nothin’ here...\nJust vibes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The sweet scent faded for some\nreason... Like my cologne.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ride your Bike? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Get off your Bike? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t get off your Bike here!\nThe ground is LAVA. Or somethin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} hatched from the Egg!\nWelcome to the world, lil homie!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna give the newly hatched\n{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} a street name?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Opp Spray wore off...\nThe opps is comin’ back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
