		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} found a Shiny Leaf!\rBut {STRVAR_1 1, 1, 0} already has a\nShiny Leaf!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh?\n{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}’s state...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00100" index="100">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} changed into its\nLand Forme!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00101" index="101">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Registered the phone number in the\nPokégear!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00102" index="102">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} is feelin’ better, so you\ndecided to take {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} with you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00103" index="103">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO!\rTell me how you feel right before a\nscrap! When you win! When you lose!\fWhat it’d be like bein’ number one!\fI’m writin’ a book. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00104" index="104">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">All right, tell me how you feel\nbefore battle!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00105" index="105">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">All right, tell me how you feel after\nyou win!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00106" index="106">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">All right, tell me how you feel after\nyou lose!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00107" index="107">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">All right, tell me how it would feel to be\nnumber one!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00108" index="108">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">’Scuse me? You won’t say? That’s too\nbad... My book gon’ be short.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00109" index="109">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks! You gon’ tell me\nanythin’ else? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00110" index="110">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Got it! Good looks! That’s chapter\none.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00111" index="111">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Got it! Good looks!\n{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}, huh... Deep. Real deep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00112" index="112">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BEFORE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00113" index="113">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WHEN YOU WIN</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00114" index="114">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WHEN YOU LOSE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0040_00115" index="115">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WHEN YOU’RE #1</language>
	</row>
